and running with Google Cloud

00:02:12.696 --> 00:02:14.000
Platform in Southeast Asia.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.670
We think GCP is the smart,
secure cloud that will

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:18.140
move your business forward.

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:19.940
And with our new
region in Singapore,

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:21.117
